cador de bater\u00eda; Silenciar micr\u00f3fono<\/li>  <li>Indicador luminoso: Bater\u00eda<\/li>  <li>Rango de la red inal\u00e1mbrica: Hasta 10 m en zonas abiertas<\/li>  <li>Requisitos m\u00ednimos del sistema: Puerto USB Type-A<\/li>  <li>Rueda de desplazamiento avanzada: Memoria<\/li>  <li>Seguridad: Cifrado AES de 128 bits<\/li>  <li>Sistemas operativos compatibles: Windows 11; Windows 10<\/li>  <li>Software de gesti\u00f3n: Software HP Accessory Center<\/li>  <li>Teclas de acceso directo: 7<\/li>  <li>Teclas especiales: Silenciar micr\u00f3fono; Dictado; Emoji<\/li>  <li>Teclas programables: Hasta 20<\/li>  <li>Tecnolog\u00eda del sensor: Seguimiento en m\u00faltiples superficies<\/li>  <li>Tipo de bater\u00eda: 2 x AAA (keyboard); 2 x AAA (mouse)<\/li>  <li>Tipo de conexi\u00f3n: Conexi\u00f3n inal\u00e1mbrica de 2,4 GHz<\/li>  <li>Tipo de teclado: Tama\u00f1o completo Dise\u00f1o de 3 zonas<\/li>  <li>Valor nominal del sensor: 4000 ppp<\/li>  <li>Vida \u00fatil de las teclas: 10 millones de pulsaciones para todas las teclas<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HP","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":56.42,"unit_price_tax":56.42,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Teclados","sub_category":"Teclados","quantity":0,"brand":"HP","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_hpa-tec%20set%20650%20bk_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":51.42}}},"8806096029756":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8806096029756",false],"wholesale_price":[1004.17,false],"price":[1009.17,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weight":["",false],"images":["",false],"tags":["",false],"featu